{
  "$schema": "../../scenario.schema.json",
  "id": "skills/a-stored-activation-reads-the-turn-s-registry",
  "title": "A room the agent serves anew reads its active skills from its stored calls against the turn's registry: a skill the last turn's registry had dropped is active again once the agent joined anew",
  "rules": [
    "§10.6.3",
    "§24.3",
    "§24.4"
  ],
  "notes": "Python: channels/_ai_context.py _given_turn_skills, _add_skills; channels/_ai_policy.py _turn_skills. channels/_ai_context.py _hydrate_room_memories, channels/_skill_activation.py seed and render_prompt. Ada's turn activates, Bob's turn drops her skill from the record, the agent joining again forgets the room (§10.6.3), and Ada's next turn reads the stored call under her registry.",
  "setup": {
    "channels": [
      {
        "id": "ws",
        "type": "websocket",
        "category": "transport"
      },
      {
        "id": "agent",
        "type": "ai",
        "skills": [],
        "config_provider": {
          "room-1": [
            {
              "skills": [
                {
                  "name": "ada-procedure",
                  "description": "The ada-procedure procedure",
                  "instructions": "Rules for ada-procedure."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "skills": [
                {
                  "name": "bob-procedure",
                  "description": "The bob-procedure procedure",
                  "instructions": "Rules for bob-procedure."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "skills": [
                {
                  "name": "ada-procedure",
                  "description": "The ada-procedure procedure",
                  "instructions": "Rules for ada-procedure."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        "model": {
          "rounds": [
            {
              "calls": [
                {
